  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Chainflip -- the native cross-chain swap protocol enabling non-custodial swaps between major assets without wrapped tokens or bridges. OASIS avatars can execute atomic cross-chain swaps via the Chainflip AMM. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
