  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ChainflipOASIS v2.0.3\n\nConnects the OASIS to Chainflip -- the native cross-chain swap protocol enabling non-custodial swaps between major assets without wrapped tokens or bridges. OASIS avatars can execute atomic cross-chain swaps via the Chainflip AMM. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- docs: add README.md for 57 providers + bump submodule pointers (87b2b85)\n- feat: add 10 new providers — 184 total (+cross-chain, +ZK identity, +edge cloud) (f39d6a4)\n- feat(ChainflipOASIS): swap quotes and tracking via the Chainflip swap API (18e5e65)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ChainflipOASIS",
